<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Pricing an iron fence in Dallas usually comes down to one question: what metal is the quote actually for? 'Wrought iron' is used for real forged iron, for welded ornamental steel and, loosely, for aluminum that is made to look like iron. The price, the rust risk and the repair options are different for each.</p><p>White Rock Fence Co is advertising that points Dallas homeowners to independent fence contractors. It builds nothing itself, and the contractor who quotes your job sets the price. This page covers the materials, how a job is scoped, what the City of Dallas says about front yards and pool barriers, and what to expect for gates, painting and rust repair. For cost context across fence types, see the <a href="/fence-cost-dallas/">Dallas fence cost guide</a>.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Handle</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">What's Included in Every Visit</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3DFD8;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A3035;margin:0 0 8px;">The metal is named on the quote</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Real wrought iron, tubular steel and aluminum all get called 'iron'. A quote you can compare names the bar, the picket size and the coating.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3DFD8;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A3035;margin:0 0 8px;">Posts set for expansive clay</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Much of the Dallas area sits on expansive clay that swells and shrinks with moisture. Ask each contractor to write down the footing they plan and how panels follow a slope.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3DFD8;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A3035;margin:0 0 8px;">Finish and rust protection spelled out</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Rust starts at welds, cut ends and chipped coating. A good quote says what primer and topcoat go on and how the cut ends are treated.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3DFD8;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A3035;margin:0 0 8px;">Gates as separate line items</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Walk gates, double drive gates and automatic gates are priced differently. Hinges, latch and any opener wiring should each be written down.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3DFD8;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A3035;margin:0 0 8px;">City and HOA checks up front</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Dallas limits front-yard fences to 4 ft, and many HOAs control fence type. Ask who files the permit and who gets the HOA approval before you sign.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3DFD8;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A3035;margin:0 0 8px;">Repair and repaint scope</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Rust repair, a bent panel or a sagging gate can be quoted by the section or by the foot. Photos and a rough length make the first conversation faster.</p>
      </div>
</div>
